OL,3,GNEWSACarys lived with endometriosis
OL,4,Apain for decades, then everything
OL,5,Achanged
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who lived with "intense" pain
OL,8,Ffrom endometriosis for decades has lost
OL,9,Fmore than half her body weight after
OL,10,Fsurgery transformed her life.
OL,12,FCarys Thurlby lost 10 stone (140lbs) in
OL,13,F18 months after having a hysterectomy,
OL,14,Fwhich she said finally brought lasting
OL,15,Frelief from years of pain and
OL,16,Fexhaustion.
OL,18,FThe 43-year-old said the change had
OL,19,Fbeen "night and day".
OL,21,F"Having intense pain had become my
OL,22,Fnormal," she said.
